{"uid":"f71d1485157872ae","name":"test_caliber_container_points_the_hugging_face_cache_at_the_persistent_volume","fullName":"tests.test_deployment_contract#test_caliber_container_points_the_hugging_face_cache_at_the_persistent_volume","historyId":"5c9c917ef2b86d148e70c13163eb64ad","time":{"start":1792792121286,"stop":1792792121341,"duration":55},"description":"HF_HOME must not fall back to the default ``$HOME/.cache/huggingface``.\n\n    The container runs as a user with no home directory (``--no-create-home``) on a\n    read-only root filesystem, so an unset HF_HOME would fail to write the embedding\n    model cache the first time a knowledge base build (or cross-encoder rerank) actually\n    runs a local Hugging Face model. Pin it to the already-mounted persistent volume\n    instead, so the cache is writable and survives container restarts/rebuilds.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>HF_HOME must not fall back to the default <code>$HOME/.cache/huggingface</code>.</p>\n<pre><code>The container runs as a user with no home directory (``--no-create-home``) on a\nread-only root filesystem, so an unset HF_HOME would fail to write the embedding\nmodel cache the first time a knowledge base build (or cross-encoder rerank) actually\nruns a local Hugging Face model. Pin it to the already-mounted persistent volume\ninstead, so the cache is writable and survives container restarts/rebuilds.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1792791300623,"stop":1792791300623,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_clear_prompt_info_cache","time":{"start":1792792121284,"stop":1792792121284,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDispl